GAP NOT RECOVERABLE
-------------------

Rows 4786 → 6434 (~1649) are permanently lost. The flush queue is
in-memory (`asyncio.Queue` in `common.llm_metrics`). When a record is
dequeued and the INSERT fails, the record is dropped (per the WARNING
"LLM usage flush failed" path — no retry). Service restarts also drop
the queue. There is no way to backfill these.

Going forward: all LLM calls are captured.
